Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:49.18,Hook,,0,0,0,,EL PERRO SE MATÓ SOLO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Creo que le maté el perro\Na Vandal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:03.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—No, ¿cómo que le mataste?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.22,0:00:06.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Es una guerra por eso.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:08.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Para que vean que no es\Nmi culpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:10.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Voy a tener que traerle\Nmucho hueso.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:13.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Voy a traer un perro en\Nbarco y todo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:14.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}para que lo…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¿Cómo se murió?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cómo lo mataste?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:20.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Es que me quiso atacar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:21.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:23.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Y lo mataste?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:25.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—No, no, no lo maté yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:27.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Es que es imbécil y se\Ntiró a un agujero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¿El perro murió?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:30.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—El perro murió.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:32.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Los dos han muerto!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:34.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¡Imposible, imposible!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:35.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Los dos han muerto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:36.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ha vuelto a morir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:37.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Han muerto dos veces.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:39.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—No creo que se haya\Nmuerto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:41.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:43.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Vandal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Sí, sí.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:47.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—En mi defensa, le tengo\Nque decir que el perro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:49.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}se mató solo.
